    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Call `dispatch_resume(timerSource)` because the system creates dispatch sources in a suspended state.",
      "normalizedSource": "Call `dispatch_resume(timerSource)` because the system creates dispatch sources in a suspended state.",
      "sourceHash": "9523302364e0f46c5f527580d16913acecf1eafb569bd2ddd044b2df139f7a1a",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "You must create the timer source by calling `dispatch_source_create(DISPATCH_SOURCE_TYPE_TIMER, 0, 0, some_dispatch_queue)` and associate an event handler with it from `dispatch_source_set_event_handler(timerSource, some_handler_block)` or `dispatch_source_set_event_handler_f(timerSource, some_handler_function)`.",
      "contextAfter": "The timebase retains the timer source, and maintains its start time according to the `CMTime` set using [`CMTimebaseSetTimerDispatchSourceNextFireTime(_:timerSource:fireTime:flags:)`](cmtimebasesettimerdispatchsourcenextfiretime(_:timersource:firetime:flags:).md).",
      "documentTitle": "CMTimebaseAddTimerDispatchSource(:timerSource:)",
      "framework": "CoreMedia",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The timebase retains the timer source, and maintains its start time according to the `CMTime` set using [`CMTimebaseSetTimerDispatchSourceNextFireTime(_:timerSource:fireTime:flags:)`](cmtimebasesettimerdispatchsourcenextfiretime(_:timersource:firetime:flags:).md).",
      "normalizedSource": "The timebase retains the timer source, and maintains its start time according to the `CMTime` set using [`CMTimebaseSetTimerDispatchSourceNextFireTime(_:timerSource:fireTime:flags:)`](cmtimebasesettimerdispatchsourcenextfiretime(_:timersource:firetime:flags:).md).",
      "sourceHash": "4bd85d13a12c6b7ca0c745ff64bde0af57f15fef9d0cf234bab2e24cf5bab829",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Call `dispatch_resume(timerSource)` because the system creates dispatch sources in a suspended state.",
      "contextAfter": "Until the first call to [`CMTimebaseSetTimerDispatchSourceNextFireTime(_:timerSource:fireTime:flags:)`](cmtimebasesettimerdispatchsourcenextfiretime(_:timersource:firetime:flags:).md), the system sets the start time to `DISPATCH_TIME_FOREVER`.",
      "documentTitle": "CMTimebaseAddTimerDispatchSource(:timerSource:)",
